123 valign=top style='width:92.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=220 valign=top style='width:164.8pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <td width=310 valign=top style='width:232.3pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=96 valign=top style='width:71.7pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=123 valign=top style='width:92.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=220 valign=top style='width:164.8pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Reference\r\nRange:-<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><span\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&lt;= 60 Years:\r\n&lt; = 1.03 mg\/l<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0&gt; 60 Years: &lt; 1.50 mg\/l<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Clinical\r\nSignificance:<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>cystatin c, is a small 13 -kDa\r\nprotein and is a member of the cysteine proteinase inhibitor family, it is\r\nproduced at a constant rate by all nucleated cells Due to its small size it is\r\nfreely filtered by the glomerulus and is not secreted but is fully reabsorbed\r\nand broken down by the renal tubules. This means that the primary determinate\r\nof blood cystatin c levels is the rate at which it is filtered at the glomerulus\r\nmaking it an excellent GFR marker. cystatin c is also a marker of inflammation\r\nand like many other markers of inflammation, it s serum concentration may be\r\nhigher in patients with decreased renal clearance. There is mounting evidence,\r\nhowever, that cystatin c may be a predictor of adverse outcomes independent of\r\nrenal function with its higher sensitivity to detect a reduced GFR than\r\nCreatinine.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Determination,\r\nalso in the so-called&quot; Creatinine-Blind&quot; range. Thus, cystatin c is\r\nsuggested to be a better marker for GFR than the ubiquitous serum Creatinine.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Please correlate\r\nwith clinical conditions.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r